{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/i18n/","title":"Type-safe i18n","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"type-safe-i18n","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Type-safe i18n"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/i18n"},{"t":"text","text":" is the CraftTS i18n integration. The catalogue remains a plain"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declarative TypeScript value, while DI-aware tokens use the existing CraftTS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"service contracts. A catalogue that does not use DI can still be formatted by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"runtime.t"},{"t":"text","text":"; a catalogue with DI is rendered through the reactive CraftTS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"translator so its dependencies are checked like component dependencies."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-contract","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The contract"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Six things are guaranteed, and all six are checked before the app runs."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"guarantee"}],[{"t":"text","text":"what it costs you to break"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"the key set is a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"closed union"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"an unknown key does not compile — no silent "},{"t":"code","text":"order.totl"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"every locale has the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"same keys with the same parameters"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"a translation you forgot is a compile error, not a fallback"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"parameters are "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"typed by their token"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"a date cannot be passed where a currency amount belongs"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"a plural carries "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"every category the locale requires"}]},{"t":"text","text":""